  "id": "3abc80ed-4b1d-4bcd-a0c6-4792128a1d7f",
  "title": "Unified 3D Gaussian Splatting Frameworks for Realistic Scene Reconstruction",
  "summary": "RealityBridge combines multimodal controls and lightweight GateNet to enhance 3DGS driving simulations, while the 4D radar-camera framework improves full-scene perception. Both methods address the need for efficient, accurate 3D reconstruction in autonomous driving and medical imaging. CasDeblurGS and VGGD both aim to reconstruct 3D scenes from two motion-blurred images, addressing the challenges of view sparsity and geometric instability in real-world applications.",
  "facts": [
