      "statement": "RealityBridge and the 4D radar-camera framework both address the need for efficient, accurate 3D reconstruction in autonomous driving and medical imaging.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "CasDeblurGS and VGGD both focus on reconstructing 3D scenes from two motion-blurred images with known intrinsics.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Both methods improve rendering quality and geometric consistency by leveraging visual geometry priors.",
      "confidence": 0.95
